\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ec3 k\xfd k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed d\xe0nh cho Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\u1ee7a FPT.eContract (g\u1ecdi t\u1eaft l\xe0 \u201cB\u1ea3n \u0110K\u0110K\u201d) quy \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ec1 quy\u1ec1n v\xe0 ngh\u0129a v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a C\xf4ng ty TNHH h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng th\xf4ng tin FPT (\u201cFIS\u201d) v\xe0 Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng trong qu\xe1 tr\xecnh Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\xe1c ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c m\xe0 FIS cung c\u1ea5p khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 FPT.eContract c\u1ee7a FIS.\nKh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c xem l\xe0 \u0111\xe3 ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn v\xe0 \u0111\u1ed3ng \xfd v\u1edbi t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\xe1c n\u1ed9i dung trong v\u0103n b\u1ea3n n\xe0y khi k\xfd t\xean tr\xean c\xe1c bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd/ thay \u0111\u1ed5i ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c ho\u1eb7c x\xe1c nh\u1eadn \u0111\u1ed3ng \xfd qua h\xecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed.\nB\u1ea3n \u0110K\u0110K n\xe0y sau khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\xfd gi\u1eefa Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng v\xe0 FIS s\u1ebd c\xf3 gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb ph\xe1p l\xfd r\xe0ng bu\u1ed9c gi\u1eefa c\xe1c b\xean v\xe0 l\xe0 m\u1ed9t b\u1ed9 ph\u1eadn kh\xf4ng t\xe1ch r\u1eddi c\u1ee7a h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 FPT.eContract \u0111\xe3 k\xfd gi\u1eefa FIS v\xe0 Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng.\n\u0110i\u1ec1u 1. \u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\xe0 ph\u1ea1m vi \xe1p d\u1ee5ng\nCh\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y cung c\u1ea5p c\xe1ch th\u1ee9c m\xe0 FIS thu th\u1eadp v\xe0 x\u1eed l\xfd, l\u01b0u tr\u1eef D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ho\u1eb7c t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\xe1c v\u1edbi s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a FIS v\xe0/ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\xf3 li\xean quan c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng theo c\xe1c m\u1ed1i quan h\u1ec7 do ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt y\xeau c\u1ea7u ph\u1ea3i thu th\u1eadp; v\xe0/ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ed3ng s\u1edf h\u1eefu, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a FIS. C\xf9ng v\u1edbi c\xe1c ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c li\xean quan \u0111\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 FPT.eContract\nFIS khuy\u1ebfn kh\xedch Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u1ecdc k\u1ef9 Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y v\xe0 th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\xean ki\u1ec3m tra trang tin \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i n\xe0o m\xe0 FIS c\xf3 th\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n theo c\xe1c \u0111i\u1ec1u kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a Ch\xednh s\xe1ch.\n\u0110i\u1ec1u 2. Gi\u1ea3i th\xedch t\u1eeb ng\u1eef\n2.1. Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng: l\xe0 c\xe1 nh\xe2n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn, t\xecm hi\u1ec3u, \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ho\u1eb7c c\xf3 li\xean quan trong quy tr\xecnh ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng, cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 FPT.eContract.\n2.2. FIS: bao g\u1ed3m C\xf4ng ty TNHH H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng th\xf4ng tin FPT v\xe0 chi nh\xe1nh, v\u0103n ph\xf2ng \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n, c\xf4ng ty th\xe0nh vi\xean thu\u1ed9c C\xf4ng ty TNHH H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng th\xf4ng tin FPT\n2.3. T\u1eadp \u0111o\xe0n FPT: bao g\u1ed3m C\xf4ng ty C\u1ed5 ph\u1ea7n FPT v\xe0 c\xe1c c\xf4ng ty th\xe0nh vi\xean thu\u1ed9c T\u1eadp \u0111o\xe0n FPT theo chu\u1ea9n qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb\n2.4. FPT.eContract: l\xe0 ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed cung c\u1ea5p n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng k\xfd v\xe0 qu\u1ea3n l\xfd h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng, th\u1ecfa thu\u1eadn h\u1ee3p t\xe1c, gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed c\xf3 gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb ph\xe1p l\xfd an to\xe0n, minh b\u1ea1ch.\n2.5. D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n hay DLCN: l\xe0 th\xf4ng tin d\u01b0\u1edbi d\u1ea1ng k\xfd hi\u1ec7u, ch\u1eef vi\u1ebft, ch\u1eef s\u1ed1, h\xecnh \u1ea3nh, \xe2m thanh ho\u1eb7c d\u1ea1ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1 tr\xean m\xf4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed g\u1eafn li\u1ec1n v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t con ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 ho\u1eb7c gi\xfap x\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh m\u1ed9t con ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3. D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n bao g\u1ed3m D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n v\xe0 D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m.\n2.6. B\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n: l\xe0 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng ph\xf2ng ng\u1eeba, ph\xe1t hi\u1ec7n, ng\u0103n ch\u1eb7n, x\u1eed l\xfd h\xe0nh vi vi ph\u1ea1m li\xean quan \u0111\u1ebfn D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt.\n2.7. X\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n: l\xe0 m\u1ed9t ho\u1eb7c nhi\u1ec1u ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng t\xe1c \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1edbi D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n, nh\u01b0: thu th\u1eadp, ghi, ph\xe2n t\xedch, x\xe1c nh\u1eadn, l\u01b0u tr\u1eef, ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda, c\xf4ng khai, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p, truy c\u1eadp, truy xu\u1ea5t, thu h\u1ed3i, m\xe3 h\xf3a, gi\u1ea3i m\xe3, sao ch\xe9p, chia s\u1ebb, truy\u1ec1n \u0111\u01b0a, cung c\u1ea5p, chuy\u1ec3n giao, x\xf3a, h\u1ee7y D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n ho\u1eb7c c\xe1c h\xe0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\xe1c c\xf3 li\xean quan.\n2.8. B\xean Ki\u1ec3m so\xe1t D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n: l\xe0 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\xe1 nh\xe2n quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh m\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch v\xe0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ti\u1ec7n x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n.\n2.9. B\xean th\u1ee9 ba: l\xe0 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\xe1 nh\xe2n kh\xe1c ngo\xe0i FIS, B\xean Ki\u1ec3m so\xe1t D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n v\xe0 Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u1ea3i th\xedch theo Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y.\n2.10. EKYC: l\xe0 h\xecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ecbnh danh v\xe0 x\xe1c th\u1ef1c kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng th\xf4ng qua vi\u1ec7c \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng c\xf4ng ngh\u1ec7 \u0111\u1ec3 x\xe1c th\u1ef1c danh t\xednh c\u1ee7a kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng d\u1ef1a tr\xean c\xe1c d\u1eef li\u1ec7u thu th\u1eadp \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\xe0 h\xecnh \u1ea3nh, video ch\xe2n dung kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng v\xe0 gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd t\xf9y th\xe2n c\u1ee7a kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng l\xe0 ch\u1ee9ng minh nh\xe2n d\xe2n, c\u0103n c\u01b0\u1edbc c\xf4ng d\xe2n ho\u1eb7c h\u1ed9 chi\u1ebfu v\xe0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed1i chi\u1ebfu v\u1edbi c\xe1c c\u01a1 s\u1edf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ec3 x\xe1c nh\u1eadn danh t\xednh c\u1ee7a kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng.\n2.12. IDCheck: l\xe0 h\xecnh th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c th\u1ebb c\u0103n c\u01b0\u1edbc c\xf4ng d\xe2n g\u1eafn Chip v\xe0 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n khu\xf4n m\u1eb7t v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9 ch\xednh x\xe1c 100% d\u1ef1a tr\xean c\xf4ng ngh\u1ec7 AI ch\u1ed1ng gi\u1ea3 m\u1ea1o x\xe1c th\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ea1t ti\xeau chu\u1ea9n Qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf (ISO 30107-3)\n2.11. X\xe1c th\u1ef1c SMS OTP: l\xe0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c trong \u0111\xf3 m\xe3 OTP \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eedi qua tin nh\u1eafn \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi k\xfd k\u1ebft trong lu\u1ed3ng k\xfd\n2.12. X\xe1c th\u1ef1c qua email: l\xe0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c trong \u0111\xf3 m\xe3 OTP \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eedi \u0111\u1ebfn email c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi k\xfd k\u1ebft trong lu\u1ed3ng k\xfd\n\u0110\u1ec3 l\xe0m r\xf5 h\u01a1n, c\xe1c t\u1eeb ng\u1eef n\xe0o ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u1ea3i th\xedch t\u1ea1i \u0110i\u1ec1u n\xe0y s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec3u v\xe0 \xe1p d\u1ee5ng theo ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt Vi\u1ec7t Nam.\n\u0110i\u1ec1u 3. M\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng v\xe0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c\n3.1. M\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch x\u1eed l\xfd d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng\n3.1.1. Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u1ed3ng \xfd cho ph\xe9p FIS v\xe0/ho\u1eb7c c\xe1c t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n kh\xe1c c\u1ee7a FIS (theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ea1i \u0110i\u1ec1u 8 Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y) x\u1eed l\xfd v\xe0 chia s\u1ebb k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 x\u1eed l\xfd DLCN cho m\u1ed9t ho\u1eb7c nhi\u1ec1u m\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch sau \u0111\xe2y:\n(a) Ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 vi\u1ec7c k\xfd k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng, t\xe0i li\u1ec7u li\xean quan \u0111\u1ebfn D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\xe0 vi\u1ec7c cung c\u1ea5p D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 gi\u1eefa FIS v\xe0 Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng;\n(b) Th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n th\u1ee7 t\u1ee5c ch\u1ee9ng th\u1ef1c h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh v\xe0 y\xeau c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a B\u1ed9 C\xf4ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng;\n(c) \u0110\xe1p \u1ee9ng c\xe1c y\xeau c\u1ea7u d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\xe0 nhu c\u1ea7u h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng;\n(d) X\xe1c minh danh t\xednh v\xe0 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o t\xednh b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt th\xf4ng tin c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt th\xf4ng tin khi mua, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 do FIS cung c\u1ea5p;\n(e) Cung c\u1ea5p s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a C\xf4ng ty \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\xeau c\u1ea7u; c\u1ee7a \u0111\u1ed1i t\xe1c/ nh\xe0 cung c\u1ea5p m\xe0 FIS l\xe0m \u0111\u1ea1i l\xfd/ h\u1ee3p t\xe1c \u0111\u1ec3 cung c\u1ea5p s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u1edbi Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng;\n(f) \u0110i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh, c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt, b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt v\xe0 c\u1ea3i ti\u1ebfn c\xe1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5, \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb m\xe0 FIS ho\u1eb7c T\u1eadp \u0111o\xe0n FPT \u0111ang cung c\u1ea5p cho Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng;\n(g) Th\xf4ng b\xe1o cho Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng v\u1ec1 nh\u1eefng thay \u0111\u1ed5i \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\xe1c ch\xednh s\xe1ch, khuy\u1ebfn m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a c\xe1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 m\xe0 FIS ho\u1eb7c T\u1eadp \u0111o\xe0n FPT \u0111ang cung c\u1ea5p;\n(h) \u0110o l\u01b0\u1eddng, ph\xe2n t\xedch d\u1eef li\u1ec7u n\u1ed9i b\u1ed9 v\xe0 c\xe1c x\u1eed l\xfd kh\xe1c \u0111\u1ec3 ph\xe1t tri\u1ec3n, c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n, n\xe2ng cao ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5/s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a FIS ho\u1eb7c T\u1eadp \u0111o\xe0n FPT ho\u1eb7c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\xe1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng truy\u1ec1n th\xf4ng, ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb;\n(i) Ng\u1eb7n ch\u1eb7n v\xe0 ph\xf2ng ch\u1ed1ng gian l\u1eadn, \u0111\xe1nh c\u1eafp danh t\xednh v\xe0 c\xe1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng b\u1ea5t h\u1ee3p ph\xe1p kh\xe1c;\n(j) \u0110\u1ec3 c\xf3 c\u01a1 s\u1edf thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp, th\u1ef1c thi c\xe1c quy\u1ec1n h\u1ee3p ph\xe1p ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 c\xe1c khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i ph\xe1p l\xfd c\u1ee7a FIS, Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 c\xe1 nh\xe2n n\xe0o. C\xe1c m\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch n\xe0y c\xf3 th\u1ec3 bao g\u1ed3m vi\u1ec7c trao \u0111\u1ed5i d\u1eef li\u1ec7u v\u1edbi c\xe1c c\xf4ng ty v\xe0 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c kh\xe1c \u0111\u1ec3 ng\u0103n ch\u1eb7n v\xe0 ph\xe1t hi\u1ec7n gian l\u1eadn, gi\u1ea3m r\u1ee7i ro v\u1ec1 t\xedn d\u1ee5ng;\n(k) Tu\xe2n th\u1ee7 ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt hi\u1ec7n h\xe0nh, c\xe1c ti\xeau chu\u1ea9n ng\xe0nh c\xf3 li\xean quan v\xe0 c\xe1c ch\xednh s\xe1ch hi\u1ec7n h\xe0nh kh\xe1c c\u1ee7a C\xf4ng ty;\n(l) B\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 m\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch n\xe0o kh\xe1c d\xe0nh ri\xeang cho ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng cung c\u1ea5p D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a FIS; v\xe0\n3.1.2. FIS s\u1ebd tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp ho\u1eb7c th\xf4ng qua B\xean Ki\u1ec3m so\xe1t D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n y\xeau c\u1ea7u s\u1ef1 cho ph\xe9p c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng theo b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 m\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch n\xe0o kh\xe1c ngo\xe0i c\xe1c m\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\xeau t\u1ea1i \u0110i\u1ec1u 3.1 tr\xean v\xe0o th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m thu th\u1eadp D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng ho\u1eb7c tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u x\u1eed l\xfd li\xean quan ho\u1eb7c theo y\xeau c\u1ea7u kh\xe1c ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt hi\u1ec7n h\xe0nh cho ph\xe9p.\n3.2. \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c\n3.2.1. \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng chung:\nKh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\u1ea7n ho\xe0n t\u1ea5t c\xe1c y\xeau c\u1ea7u \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd, ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 \u0111i\u1ec1u kho\u1ea3n \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 FPT.eContract trong \u0111\xf3 y\xeau c\u1ea7u th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\xe1c ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c v\xe0 \u0111i\u1ec1u kho\u1ea3n \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a FPT.eContract \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c quy \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ea1i t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3.\n3.2.2. \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ri\xeang theo t\u1eebng ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c\n(a) Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c EKYC\n- C\xf3 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb di \u0111\u1ed9ng ho\u1eb7c m\xe1y t\xednh b\u1ea3ng c\xf3 camera\n- \u0110\u0103ng k\xfd s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c EKYC v\u1edbi FPT.eContract theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a FIS trong t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3.\n(b) Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c IDCheck\n- C\xf3 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb di \u0111\u1ed9ng ho\u1eb7c m\xe1y t\xednh b\u1ea3ng c\xf3 camera h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 NFC\n- C\xf3 CCCD g\u1eafn ch\xedp\n- \u0110\u0103ng k\xfd s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c IDCheck v\u1edbi FPT.eContract theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a FIS trong t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3.\n(c) Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c SMS OTP\n- C\xf3 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb di \u0111\u1ed9ng k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i m\u1ea1ng vi\u1ec5n th\xf4ng theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a FPT.eContract trong t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3\n- L\xe0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi k\xfd k\u1ebft c\xf3 trong lu\u1ed3ng k\xfd v\xe0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u1edfi t\u1ea1o nh\u1eadp \u0111\xfang s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i\n(d) Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c email OTP\n- L\xe0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi k\xfd k\u1ebft c\xf3 trong lu\u1ed3ng k\xfd v\xe0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u1edfi t\u1ea1o nh\u1eadp \u0111\xfang email\n\u0110i\u1ec1u 4. B\u1ea3o m\u1eadt D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng\n4.1. D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cam k\u1ebft b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt t\u1ed1i \u0111a theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a FIS v\xe0 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt. Vi\u1ec7c x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a m\u1ed7i Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n khi c\xf3 s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed3ng \xfd c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng, tr\u1eeb tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt c\xf3 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\xe1c.\n4.2. FIS kh\xf4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, chuy\u1ec3n giao, cung c\u1ea5p hay chia s\u1ebb cho b\xean th\u1ee9 ba n\xe0o v\u1ec1 D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng khi kh\xf4ng c\xf3 s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed3ng \xfd c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng, tr\u1eeb tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt c\xf3 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\xe1c.\n4.3. FIS s\u1ebd tu\xe2n th\u1ee7 c\xe1c nguy\xean t\u1eafc b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n kh\xe1c theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt hi\u1ec7n h\xe0nh.\n\u0110i\u1ec1u 5. C\xe1c lo\u1ea1i D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n m\xe0 FIS thu th\u1eadp, x\u1eed l\xfd\n\u0110\u1ec3 FIS c\xf3 th\u1ec3 cung c\u1ea5p D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 cho Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng v\xe0/ho\u1eb7c x\u1eed l\xfd c\xe1c y\xeau c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng v\xe0/ho\u1eb7c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n M\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch quy \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ea1i \u0110i\u1ec1u 3 Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y, FIS \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c quy\u1ec1n thu th\u1eadp ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec1 ngh\u1ecb \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u1ea3i thu th\u1eadp c\xe1c lo\u1ea1i D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n, sau:\n5.1. D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng v\xe0 c\xe1c c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\xf3 li\xean quan c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng:\n(a) H\u1ecd, ch\u1eef \u0111\u1ec7m v\xe0 t\xean khai sinh, t\xean g\u1ecdi kh\xe1c (n\u1ebfu c\xf3)\n(b) Ng\xe0y, th\xe1ng, n\u0103m sinh\n(c) N\u01a1i sinh, n\u01a1i \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd khai sinh, n\u01a1i th\u01b0\u1eddng tr\xfa, n\u01a1i t\u1ea1m tr\xfa, n\u01a1i \u1edf hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i, qu\xea qu\xe1n, \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 li\xean h\u1ec7\n(d) Gi\u1edbi t\xednh\n(e) \u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 li\xean h\u1ec7\n(f) Qu\u1ed1c t\u1ecbch\n(g) H\xecnh \u1ea3nh c\u1ee7a c\xe1 nh\xe2n\n(h) S\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, s\u1ed1 ch\u1ee9ng minh nh\xe2n d\xe2n, s\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh danh c\xe1 nh\xe2n, s\u1ed1 h\u1ed9 chi\u1ebfu, s\u1ed1 gi\u1ea5y ph\xe9p l\xe1i xe, s\u1ed1 bi\u1ec3n s\u1ed1 xe, s\u1ed1 m\xe3 s\u1ed1 thu\u1ebf c\xe1 nh\xe2n, s\u1ed1 b\u1ea3o hi\u1ec3m x\xe3 h\u1ed9i, s\u1ed1 th\u1ebb b\u1ea3o hi\u1ec3m y t\u1ebf\n(i) C\xe1c th\xf4ng tin kh\xe1c g\u1eafn li\u1ec1n v\u1edbi Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng ho\u1eb7c gi\xfap x\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng v\xe0 kh\xf4ng thu\u1ed9c D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m\n(j) C\xe1c d\u1eef li\u1ec7u kh\xe1c theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt hi\u1ec7n h\xe0nh\n5.2. D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n b\u1ed5 sung g\u1eafn li\u1ec1n v\u1edbi quy\u1ec1n ri\xeang t\u01b0 c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng g\u1ed3m:\n(a) D\u1eef li\u1ec7u v\u1ec1 v\u1ecb tr\xed c\u1ee7a c\xe1 nh\xe2n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh qua d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ecb\n(b) D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n kh\xe1c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt quy \u0111\u1ecbnh l\xe0 \u0111\u1eb7c th\xf9 v\xe0 c\u1ea7n c\xf3 bi\u1ec7n ph\xe1p b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft\nFIS tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i kh\xf4ng thu nh\u1eadp c\xe1c d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n li\xean quan \u0111\u1ebfn t\xf4n gi\xe1o, quan \u0111i\u1ec3m ch\xednh tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng.\n5.3. D\u1eef li\u1ec7u li\xean quan \u0111\u1ebfn c\xe1c trang tin \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed ho\u1eb7c \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng: d\u1eef li\u1ec7u k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt (nh\u01b0 \u0111\xe3 n\xeau \u1edf tr\xean, bao g\u1ed3m lo\u1ea1i thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb, h\u1ec7 \u0111i\u1ec1u h\xe0nh, lo\u1ea1i tr\xecnh duy\u1ec7t, c\xe0i \u0111\u1eb7t tr\xecnh duy\u1ec7t, \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 IP, c\xe0i \u0111\u1eb7t ng\xf4n ng\u1eef, ng\xe0y v\xe0 gi\u1edd k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi trang tin \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, th\u1ed1ng k\xea s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, c\xe0i \u0111\u1eb7t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, ng\xe0y v\xe0 gi\u1edd k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, d\u1eef li\u1ec7u v\u1ecb tr\xed v\xe0 th\xf4ng tin li\xean l\u1ea1c k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt kh\xe1c); chi ti\u1ebft \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt; d\u1eef li\u1ec7u s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, ...\n\u0110i\u1ec1u 6. C\xe1ch th\u1ee9c thu th\u1eadp D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n\nFIS th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n thu th\u1eadp D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n t\u1eeb Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng theo c\xe1c ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c sau:\n6.1. Tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp t\u1eeb Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng b\u1eb1ng c\xe1c c\xe1ch th\u1ee9c kh\xe1c nhau:\n(a) Khi Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng k\xfd h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng, mua ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a FIS ho\u1eb7c c\u1ee7a b\xean th\u1ee9 ba th\xf4ng qua FIS ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1i c\xe1c \u0111i\u1ec3m giao d\u1ecbch, c\u01a1 s\u1edf kinh doanh c\u1ee7a FIS;\n(b) Khi Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng g\u1eedi y\xeau c\u1ea7u \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu n\xe0o kh\xe1c li\xean quan t\u1edbi D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a FIS;\n(c) Khi Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\xe1c v\u1edbi nh\xe2n vi\xean d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\u1ee7a C\xf4ng ty, v\xed d\u1ee5 nh\u01b0 th\xf4ng qua c\xe1c cu\u1ed9c g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, th\u01b0 t\u1eeb, g\u1eb7p m\u1eb7t tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp, g\u1eedi th\u01b0 \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed ho\u1eb7c t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\xe1c tr\xean m\u1ea1ng x\xe3 h\u1ed9i;\n(d) Khi Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a FIS, v\xed d\u1ee5 nh\u01b0 c\xe1c trang web v\xe0 \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng bao g\u1ed3m vi\u1ec7c thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp c\xe1c t\xe0i kho\u1ea3n tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn v\u1edbi FIS;\n(e) Khi Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c li\xean h\u1ec7 v\xe0 ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i l\u1ea1i c\xe1c \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb v\xe0 c\xe1c nh\xe2n vi\xean d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\u1ee7a FIS;\n(f) Khi Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng g\u1eedi th\xf4ng tin c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a m\xecnh cho FIS v\xec b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 l\xfd do n\xe0o kh\xe1c, bao g\u1ed3m c\u1ea3 khi Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u1eed mi\u1ec5n ph\xed b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\xe0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\xe0o ho\u1eb7c khi Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n quan t\xe2m \u0111\u1ebfn b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\xe0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\xe0o c\u1ee7a FIS.\n6.2. T\u1eeb c\xe1c b\xean th\u1ee9 ba kh\xe1c:\n(a) N\u1ebfu Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\xe1c v\u1edbi n\u1ed9i dung ho\u1eb7c qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o c\u1ee7a b\xean th\u1ee9 ba tr\xean trang tin \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed ho\u1eb7c trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, C\xf4ng ty c\xf3 th\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\xf4ng tin c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng t\u1eeb b\xean th\u1ee9 ba c\xf3 li\xean quan, theo ch\xednh s\xe1ch b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt hi\u1ec7n h\xe0nh h\u1ee3p ph\xe1p c\u1ee7a b\xean th\u1ee9 ba \u0111\xf3;\n(b) N\u1ebfu Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng ch\u1ecdn thanh to\xe1n \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp t\u1edbi FIS ho\u1eb7c th\xf4ng qua trang tin \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed ho\u1eb7c \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, FIS c\xf3 th\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng t\u1eeb c\xe1c b\xean th\u1ee9 ba, ch\u1eb3ng h\u1ea1n nh\u01b0 nh\xe0 cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 thanh to\xe1n, cho m\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch thanh to\xe1n \u0111\xf3;\n(c) \u0110\u1ec3 tu\xe2n th\u1ee7 c\xe1c ngh\u0129a v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a m\xecnh theo lu\u1eadt hi\u1ec7n h\xe0nh, FIS c\xf3 th\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp nh\u1eadn D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n v\u1ec1 Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng t\u1eeb c\xe1c c\u01a1 quan ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt v\xe0 c\u01a1 quan c\xf4ng quy\u1ec1n theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt;\n(d) FIS c\xf3 th\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n v\u1ec1 Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng t\u1eeb c\xe1c ngu\u1ed3n c\xf4ng khai (nh\u01b0 danh b\u1ea1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, th\xf4ng tin qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o/t\u1edd r\u01a1i, c\xe1c th\xf4ng tin \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\xf4ng khai tr\xean c\xe1c trang tin \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, v.v.);\n(e) B\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 khi n\xe0o thu th\u1eadp D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n nh\u01b0 v\u1eady, FIS s\u1ebd \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o vi\u1ec7c nh\u1eadn d\u1eef li\u1ec7u t\u1eeb c\xe1c b\xean th\u1ee9 ba c\xf3 li\xean quan theo nh\u1eefng c\xe1ch h\u1ee3p ph\xe1p, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi y\xeau c\u1ea7u c\xe1c b\xean th\u1ee9 ba \u0111\xf3 ch\u1ecbu tr\xe1ch nhi\u1ec7m tu\xe2n th\u1ee7 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt v\u1ec1 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n.\n\u0110i\u1ec1u 7. C\xe1ch th\u1ee9c x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u\nFIS \xe1p d\u1ee5ng m\u1ed9t ho\u1eb7c nhi\u1ec1u ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng t\xe1c \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1edbi d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n nh\u01b0: thu th\u1eadp, ghi, ph\xe2n t\xedch, x\xe1c nh\u1eadn, l\u01b0u tr\u1eef, ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda, c\xf4ng khai, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p, truy c\u1eadp, truy xu\u1ea5t, thu h\u1ed3i, m\xe3 h\xf3a, gi\u1ea3i m\xe3, sao ch\xe9p, chia s\u1ebb, truy\u1ec1n \u0111\u01b0a, cung c\u1ea5p, chuy\u1ec3n giao, x\xf3a, h\u1ee7y d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n ho\u1eb7c c\xe1c h\xe0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\xe1c c\xf3 li\xean quan.\n\u0110i\u1ec1u 8. T\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n\n8.1. FIS (C\xf4ng ty TNHH H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng th\xf4ng tin FPT).\n8.2. FIS s\u1ebd th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n vi\u1ec7c chia s\u1ebb ho\u1eb7c c\xf9ng x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n v\u1edbi c\xe1c t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\xe1 nh\xe2n sau:\n(a) T\u1eadp \u0111o\xe0n FPT v\xe0 c\xe1c C\xf4ng ty th\xe0nh vi\xean thu\u1ed9c T\u1eadp \u0111o\xe0n FPT.\n(b) C\xe1c C\xf4ng ty th\xe0nh vi\xean m\xe0 FIS tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp ho\u1eb7c gi\xe1n ti\u1ebfp s\u1edf h\u1eefu.\n(c) C\xe1c nh\xe0 th\u1ea7u, \u0111\u1ea1i l\xfd, \u0111\u1ed1i t\xe1c v\xe0 c\xe1c nh\xe0 cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\xe0nh, c\u1ee7a FIS.\n(d) C\xe1c chi nh\xe1nh, \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb kinh doanh v\xe0 c\xe1c c\xe1n b\u1ed9 nh\xe2n vi\xean l\xe0m vi\u1ec7c t\u1ea1i c\xe1c chi nh\xe1nh, \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb kinh doanh, \u0111\u1ea1i l\xfd c\u1ee7a FIS.\n(e) C\xe1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p kinh doanh vi\u1ec5n th\xf4ng trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng vi ph\u1ea1m ngh\u0129a v\u1ee5 thanh to\xe1n c\u01b0\u1edbc d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5.\n(f) C\xe1c c\u1eeda h\xe0ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i v\xe0 nh\xe0 b\xe1n l\u1ebb li\xean quan t\u1edbi vi\u1ec7c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\xe1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\xecnh khuy\u1ebfn m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a FIS.\n(g) C\xe1c c\u1ed1 v\u1ea5n chuy\xean nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ee7a FIS nh\u01b0 ki\u1ec3m to\xe1n, lu\u1eadt s\u01b0,\u2026 theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt.\n(h) T\xf2a \xe1n, c\xe1c c\u01a1 quan nh\xe0 n\u01b0\u1edbc c\xf3 th\u1ea9m quy\u1ec1n ph\xf9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt v\xe0/ho\u1eb7c khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\xeau c\u1ea7u v\xe0 ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt cho ph\xe9p.\n8.3. FIS cam k\u1ebft vi\u1ec7c chia s\u1ebb ho\u1eb7c c\xf9ng x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n ch\u1ec9 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\xe1c M\u1ee5c \u0110\xedch X\u1eed L\xfd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\xeau t\u1ea1i Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y ho\u1eb7c theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt. C\xe1c t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\xe1 nh\xe2n nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng s\u1ebd ph\u1ea3i tu\xe2n th\u1ee7 theo n\u1ed9i dung quy \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ea1i Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y v\xe0 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt v\u1ec1 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n li\xean quan.\nM\u1eb7c d\xf9 FIS s\u1ebd th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n m\u1ecdi n\u1ed7 l\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o r\u1eb1ng c\xe1c th\xf4ng tin Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u1ea9n danh/m\xe3 h\xf3a, nh\u01b0ng kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 lo\u1ea1i tr\u1eeb ho\xe0n to\xe0n r\u1ee7i ro c\xe1c d\u1eef li\u1ec7u n\xe0y c\xf3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb ti\u1ebft l\u1ed9 trong nh\u1eefng tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p b\u1ea5t kh\u1ea3 kh\xe1ng.\n8.4. Trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p c\xf3 s\u1ef1 tham gia c\u1ee7a c\xe1c t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n kh\xe1c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\xeau t\u1ea1i \u0110i\u1ec1u n\xe0y, FIS s\u1ebd th\xf4ng b\xe1o cho Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n.\n\u0110i\u1ec1u 9. Quy\u1ec1n v\xe0 ngh\u0129a v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng cung c\u1ea5p D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n cho FIS\n9.1. Quy\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng\n(a) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\xf3 quy\u1ec1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c bi\u1ebft v\u1ec1 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a m\xecnh, tr\u1eeb tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt c\xf3 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\xe1c.\n(b) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed3ng \xfd ho\u1eb7c kh\xf4ng \u0111\u1ed3ng \xfd cho ph\xe9p x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a m\xecnh, tr\u1eeb tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p lu\u1eadt c\xf3 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\xe1c.\n(c) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp \u0111\u1ec3 xem, ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda ho\u1eb7c y\xeau c\u1ea7u ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a m\xecnh b\u1eb1ng v\u0103n b\u1ea3n g\u1eedi \u0111\u1ebfn FIS ho\u1eb7c B\xean Ki\u1ec3m so\xe1t D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n, tr\u1eeb tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p lu\u1eadt c\xf3 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\xe1c.\n(d) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\xf3 quy\u1ec1n r\xfat l\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed3ng \xfd c\u1ee7a m\xecnh b\u1eb1ng v\u0103n b\u1ea3n g\u1eedi \u0111\u1ebfn FIS/B\xean ki\u1ec3m so\xe1t D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n, tr\u1eeb tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt c\xf3 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\xe1c. Vi\u1ec7c r\xfat l\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed3ng \xfd kh\xf4ng \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn t\xednh h\u1ee3p ph\xe1p c\u1ee7a vi\u1ec7c x\u1eed l\xfd d\u1eef li\u1ec7u \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u1ed3ng \xfd v\u1edbi FIS tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi r\xfat l\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed3ng \xfd.\n(e) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c quy\u1ec1n x\xf3a ho\u1eb7c y\xeau c\u1ea7u x\xf3a D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a m\xecnh b\u1eb1ng v\u0103n b\u1ea3n g\u1eedi \u0111\u1ebfn FIS, tr\u1eeb tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p lu\u1eadt c\xf3 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\xe1c.\n(f) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c quy\u1ec1n y\xeau c\u1ea7u h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a m\xecnh b\u1eb1ng v\u0103n b\u1ea3n g\u1eedi \u0111\u1ebfn FIS, tr\u1eeb tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p lu\u1eadt c\xf3 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\xe1c.\n(g) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c quy\u1ec1n y\xeau c\u1ea7u FIS/B\xean Ki\u1ec3m so\xe1t D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n cung c\u1ea5p cho b\u1ea3n th\xe2n D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a m\xecnh b\u1eb1ng v\u0103n b\u1ea3n g\u1eedi \u0111\u1ebfn FIS, tr\u1eeb tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p lu\u1eadt c\xf3 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\xe1c.\n(h) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c quy\u1ec1n ph\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed1i FIS, B\xean Ki\u1ec3m so\xe1t D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n quy \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ea1i Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a m\xecnh b\u1eb1ng v\u0103n b\u1ea3n g\u1eedi \u0111\u1ebfn FIS, B\xean Ki\u1ec3m so\xe1t D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n nh\u1eb1m ng\u0103n ch\u1eb7n ho\u1eb7c h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf vi\u1ec7c ti\u1ebft l\u1ed9 D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n cho m\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o, ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb, tr\u1eeb tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt c\xf3 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\xe1c.\n(i) Sau khi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\xe1c y\xeau c\u1ea7u v\u1ec1: cung c\u1ea5p d\u1eef li\u1ec7u; h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf x\u1eed l\xfd d\u1eef li\u1ec7u; y\xeau c\u1ea7u ph\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed1i x\u1eed l\xfd d\u1eef li\u1ec7u; ho\u1eb7c x\xf3a D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n, FIS/B\xean Ki\u1ec3m so\xe1t D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n s\u1ebd th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n y\xeau c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng trong 72 gi\u1edd sau khi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\xeau c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a ch\u1ee7 th\u1ec3 D\u1eef li\u1ec7u t\xf9y t\u1eebng tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt.\n(j) \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi y\xeau c\u1ea7u ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda d\u1eef li\u1ec7u, tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n FIS/B\xean Ki\u1ec3m so\xe1t D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n s\u1ebd th\xf4ng b\xe1o t\u1edbi Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng sau 72 gi\u1edd k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb khi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\xeau c\u1ea7u.\n(k) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\xf3 quy\u1ec1n khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i, t\u1ed1 c\xe1o ho\u1eb7c kh\u1edfi ki\u1ec7n theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt.\n(l) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\xf3 quy\u1ec1n y\xeau c\u1ea7u b\u1ed3i th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi thi\u1ec7t h\u1ea1i th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt n\u1ebfu FIS c\xf3 h\xe0nh vi vi ph\u1ea1m quy \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ec1 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a m\xecnh, tr\u1eeb tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p c\xe1c b\xean c\xf3 th\u1ecfa thu\u1eadn kh\xe1c ho\u1eb7c lu\u1eadt c\xf3 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\xe1c.\n(m) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\xf3 quy\u1ec1n t\u1ef1 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a B\u1ed9 lu\u1eadt D\xe2n s\u1ef1, lu\u1eadt kh\xe1c c\xf3 li\xean quan, ho\u1eb7c y\xeau c\u1ea7u c\u01a1 quan, t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c c\xf3 th\u1ea9m quy\u1ec1n th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\xe1c ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 quy\u1ec1n d\xe2n s\u1ef1 theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ea1i \u0110i\u1ec1u 11 B\u1ed9 lu\u1eadt D\xe2n s\u1ef1.\n(n) C\xe1c quy\u1ec1n kh\xe1c theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt hi\u1ec7n h\xe0nh.\n(o) C\xf3 quy\u1ec1n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\xe1c ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c do FPT.eContract cung c\u1ea5p.\n(p) Y\xeau c\u1ea7u FPT.eContract c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt c\xe1c th\xf4ng tin \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, y\xeau c\u1ea7u c\u1ea5p l\u1ea1i m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u, kh\xf3a, m\u1edf kh\xf3a/k\xedch ho\u1ea1t l\u1ea1i ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c theo th\u1ee7 t\u1ee5c \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt m\xe0 FPT.eContract quy \u0111\u1ecbnh. FPT.eContract s\u1ebd th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n y\xeau c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng sau khi ti\u1ebfn h\xe0nh ki\u1ec3m tra v\xe0 ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn y\xeau c\u1ea7u n\xe0y.\n(q) C\xf3 quy\u1ec1n \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd thay \u0111\u1ed5i ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c, h\u1ea1n m\u1ee9c giao d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c trong gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n cho ph\xe9p t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng v\u1edbi g\xf3i d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5.\n(r) C\xf3 quy\u1ec1n khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i v\u1edbi FPT.eContract v\u1ec1 c\xe1c sai s\xf3t, vi ph\u1ea1m (n\u1ebfu c\xf3) ph\xe1t sinh trong qu\xe1 tr\xecnh s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt. Vi\u1ec7c khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ng\xe2n h\xe0ng m\xe0 Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.\n(s) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\xf3 quy\u1ec1n y\xeau c\u1ea7u ch\u1ea5m d\u1ee9t s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c. - Th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\xe1c quy\u1ec1n kh\xe1c c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ea1i B\u1ea3n \u0110K\u0110K n\xe0y v\xe0 c\xe1c quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\xf3 li\xean quan c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt.\n9.2. Ngh\u0129a v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng\n(a) Tu\xe2n th\u1ee7 c\xe1c quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt, quy \u0111\u1ecbnh, h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u1ee7a FIS li\xean quan \u0111\u1ebfn x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng.\n(b) Cung c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7, trung th\u1ef1c, ch\xednh x\xe1c D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n, c\xe1c th\xf4ng tin kh\xe1c theo y\xeau c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a FIS khi \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd v\xe0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a FIS v\xe0 khi c\xf3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i v\u1ec1 c\xe1c th\xf4ng tin n\xe0y. FIS s\u1ebd ti\u1ebfn h\xe0nh b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\u0103n c\u1ee9 tr\xean th\xf4ng tin Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd, do \u0111\xf3 n\u1ebfu c\xf3 b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 th\xf4ng tin sai l\u1ec7ch n\xe0o FIS s\u1ebd kh\xf4ng ch\u1ecbu tr\xe1ch nhi\u1ec7m trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p th\xf4ng tin \u0111\xf3 l\xe0m \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng ho\u1eb7c h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf quy\u1ec1n l\u1ee3i c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng. Tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p kh\xf4ng th\xf4ng b\xe1o, n\u1ebfu c\xf3 ph\xe1t sinh r\u1ee7i ro, t\u1ed5n th\u1ea5t th\xec Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng ch\u1ecbu tr\xe1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 nh\u1eefng sai s\xf3t hay h\xe0nh vi l\u1ee3i d\u1ee5ng, l\u1eeba \u0111\u1ea3o khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 do l\u1ed7i c\u1ee7a m\xecnh ho\u1eb7c do kh\xf4ng cung c\u1ea5p \u0111\xfang, \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7, ch\xednh x\xe1c, k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi s\u1ef1 thay \u0111\u1ed5i th\xf4ng tin; bao g\u1ed3m c\u1ea3 thi\u1ec7t h\u1ea1i v\u1ec1 t\xe0i ch\xednh, chi ph\xed ph\xe1t sinh do th\xf4ng tin cung c\u1ea5p sai ho\u1eb7c kh\xf4ng th\u1ed1ng nh\u1ea5t.\n(c) Ph\u1ed1i h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi FIS, c\u01a1 quan nh\xe0 n\u01b0\u1edbc c\xf3 th\u1ea9m quy\u1ec1n ho\u1eb7c b\xean th\u1ee9 ba trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p ph\xe1t sinh c\xe1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn t\xednh b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng.\n(d) T\u1ef1 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a m\xecnh; ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng \xe1p d\u1ee5ng c\xe1c bi\u1ec7n ph\xe1p nh\u1eb1m b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a m\xecnh trong qu\xe1 tr\xecnh s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a FIS; th\xf4ng b\xe1o k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi cho FIS khi ph\xe1t hi\u1ec7n th\u1ea5y c\xf3 sai s\xf3t, nh\u1ea7m l\u1eabn v\u1ec1 D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a m\xecnh ho\u1eb7c nghi ng\u1edd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a m\xecnh \u0111ang b\u1ecb x\xe2m ph\u1ea1m.\n(e) T\u1ef1 ch\u1ecbu tr\xe1ch nhi\u1ec7m \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng th\xf4ng tin, d\u1eef li\u1ec7u, ch\u1ea5p thu\u1eadn m\xe0 m\xecnh t\u1ea1o l\u1eadp, cung c\u1ea5p tr\xean m\xf4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng m\u1ea1ng; t\u1ef1 ch\u1ecbu tr\xe1ch nhi\u1ec7m trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n b\u1ecb r\xf2 r\u1ec9, x\xe2m ph\u1ea1m do l\u1ed7i c\u1ee7a m\xecnh.\n(f) Th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\xean c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt c\xe1c Quy \u0111\u1ecbnh, Ch\xednh s\xe1ch c\u1ee7a FIS trong t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\xf4ng b\xe1o t\u1edbi Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i tr\xean c\xe1c website v\xe0 ho\u1eb7c c\xe1c k\xeanh giao d\u1ecbch kh\xe1c c\u1ee7a FIS t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3. Th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\xe1c h\xe0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng theo h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u1ee7a FIS \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n r\xf5 vi\u1ec7c ch\u1ea5p thu\u1eadn ho\u1eb7c kh\xf4ng ch\u1ea5p thu\u1eadn \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\xe1c m\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n m\xe0 FIS th\xf4ng b\xe1o t\u1edbi Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng trong t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3.\n(g) T\xf4n tr\u1ecdng, b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\xe1c.\n(h) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng ch\u1ecbu tr\xe1ch nhi\u1ec7m \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o qu\xe1 tr\xecnh \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd, thao t\xe1c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c ch\xednh x\xe1c v\xe0 \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 tu\xe2n theo h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u1ee7a FPT.eContract.\n(i) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng ch\u1ecbu tr\xe1ch nhi\u1ec7m b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt c\xe1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb c\xe0i \u0111\u1eb7t ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c ho\u1eb7c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb nh\u1eadn m\xe3 OTP, th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\xe1c bi\u1ec7n ph\xe1p ph\xf2ng tr\xe1nh v\xe0 ng\u0103n ch\u1eb7n vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed dung tr\xe1i ph\xe9p c\xe1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb \u0111\xf3 trong kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng c\u1ee7a m\xecnh.\n(j) Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\xf3 ngh\u0129a v\u1ee5 b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt th\xf4ng tin c\u1ee7a ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c v\xe0/ ho\u1eb7c c\xe1c th\xf4ng tin kh\xe1c li\xean quan do FPT.eContract cung c\u1ea5p. M\u1ecdi giao d\u1ecbch \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c th\xf4ng qua t\xean truy c\u1eadp, m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u v\xe0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c m\xe0 FPT.eContract cung c\u1ea5p cho Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec3u l\xe0 giao d\u1ecbch \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n theo \xfd ch\xed c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng.\n(k) Ch\u1ec9 c\xe1c ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c do FPT.eContract cung c\u1ea5p tr\xean c\xe1c k\xeanh giao d\u1ecbch ch\xednh th\u1ee9c, do FPT.eContract quy \u0111\u1ecbnh trong t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3, m\u1edbi c\xf3 gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb ph\xe1p l\xfd v\xe0 r\xe0ng bu\u1ed9c c\xe1c b\xean li\xean quan.\n(l) Ho\xe0n to\xe0n ch\u1ecbu tr\xe1ch nhi\u1ec7m khi t\xean truy c\u1eadp, m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u, th\xf4ng tin x\xe1c th\u1ef1c b\u1ecb l\u1ed9, b\u1ecb \u0111\xe1nh c\u1eafp, b\u1ecb l\u1ee3i d\u1ee5ng c\xf3 nguy\xean nh\xe2n xu\u1ea5t ph\xe1t t\u1eeb ph\xeda Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng, k\u1ec3 c\u1ea3 khi v\u0103n b\u1ea3n n\xe0y h\u1ebft hi\u1ec7u l\u1ef1c.\n(m) Khi c\xf3 nhu c\u1ea7u ng\u1eebng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\xe1c th\u1ef1c, Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\xf3 tr\xe1ch nhi\u1ec7m th\xf4ng b\xe1o cho FPT.eContract b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t trong c\xe1c h\xecnh th\u1ee9c sau theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a FPT.eContract trong t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3.\n(n) C\xe1c tr\xe1ch nhi\u1ec7m kh\xe1c theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt.\n\u0110i\u1ec1u 10. L\u01b0u tr\u1eef D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n\nFIS cam k\u1ebft s\u1ebd ch\u1ec9 l\u01b0u tr\u1eef D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p li\xean quan \u0111\u1ebfn c\xe1c m\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\xeau trong Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y. Th\u1eddi gian l\u01b0u tr\u1eef D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n s\u1ebd l\xe0 10 (m\u01b0\u1eddi) n\u0103m k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m thu th\u1eadp. Th\u1eddi h\u1ea1n n\xe0y c\xf3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh theo quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a FIS t\u1ea1i t\u1eebng th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1eb1m b\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ea3m th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\xe1c m\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch n\xeau tr\xean v\xe0/ho\u1eb7c tu\xe2n th\u1ee7 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt.\n\u0110i\u1ec1u 11. H\u1eadu qu\u1ea3, thi\u1ec7t h\u1ea1i kh\xf4ng mong mu\u1ed1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 x\u1ea3y ra\nHi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i, FIS ch\u01b0a th\u1ea5y h\u1eadu qu\u1ea3, thi\u1ec7t h\u1ea1i kh\xf4ng mong mu\u1ed1n n\xe0o c\xf3 th\u1ec3 x\u1ea3y ra, FIS s\u1ebd th\xf4ng b\xe1o n\u1ebfu x\u1ea3y ra tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3. Trong qu\xe1 tr\xecnh x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n, th\xec c\xf3 th\u1ec3 x\u1ea3y ra l\u1ed9, l\u1ecdt d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n do:\n11.1. T\u1eeb ph\xeda Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng: Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng l\xe0m l\u1ed9, l\u1ecdt d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n do: b\u1ea5t c\u1ea9n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ecb l\u1eeba \u0111\u1ea3o; truy c\u1eadp c\xe1c website/t\u1ea3i c\xe1c \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng c\xf3 ch\u1ee9a ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m \u0111\u1ed9c h\u1ea1i, ....\n11.2. T\u1eeb ph\xeda FIS: FIS cam k\u1ebft s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\xe1c c\xf4ng ngh\u1ec7 b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt th\xf4ng tin nh\u1eb1m b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng. Tuy nhi\xean, kh\xf4ng m\u1ed9t d\u1eef li\u1ec7u n\xe0o c\xf3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt 100%, c\xf3 th\u1ec3 l\u1ed7i ph\u1ea7n c\u1ee9ng, ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m trong qu\xe1 tr\xecnh x\u1eed l\xfd d\u1eef li\u1ec7u l\xe0m m\u1ea5t d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng; ho\u1eb7c l\u1ed7 h\u1ed5ng b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt n\u1eb1m ngo\xe0i kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ki\u1ec3m so\xe1t c\u1ee7a FIS, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng c\xf3 li\xean quan b\u1ecb hacker t\u1ea5n c\xf4ng g\xe2y l\u1ed9, l\u1ecdt d\u1eef li\u1ec7u; \u2026\n\u0110i\u1ec1u 12. Th\xf4ng tin li\xean h\u1ec7 x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n\nTr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\xf3 b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 c\xe2u h\u1ecfi n\xe0o li\xean quan \u0111\u1ebfn Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y ho\u1eb7c c\xe1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 li\xean quan \u0111\u1ebfn quy\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a ch\u1ee7 th\u1ec3 d\u1eef li\u1ec7u ho\u1eb7c x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng, Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng h\xe0ng c\xf3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\xe1c h\xecnh th\u1ee9c li\xean h\u1ec7 n\xeau sau:\n\u0110\u1ecaA CH\u1ec8: T\xc2\u0300NG 22, T\xd2A NH\xc0 KEANGNAM LANDMARK TOWER, E6, \u0110\u01af\u1edcNG PH\u1ea0M H\xd9NG, M\xca\u0303 TR\xcc, QU\u1eacN NAM T\u1eea LI\xcaM, H\xc0 N\xd4\u0323I, VI\u1ec6T NAM. EMAIL: customersupport@fpt.com HOTLINE 24/7: 1900.636.191 - ext 3\n\u0110i\u1ec1u 13. \u0110i\u1ec1u kho\u1ea3n chung\n13.1. Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y c\xf3 hi\u1ec7u l\u1ef1c t\u1eeb ng\xe0y 01/07/2023. Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng hi\u1ec3u v\xe0 \u0111\u1ed3ng \xfd r\u1eb1ng, Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y c\xf3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eeda \u0111\u1ed5i theo t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3 v\xe0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\xf4ng b\xe1o t\u1edbi Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng th\xf4ng qua c\xe1c K\xeanh giao d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a FIS tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \xe1p d\u1ee5ng. Nh\u1eefng thay \u0111\u1ed5i v\xe0 th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m c\xf3 hi\u1ec7u l\u1ef1c s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt v\xe0 c\xf4ng b\u1ed1 t\u1ea1i c\xe1c K\xeanh giao d\u1ecbch v\xe0 c\xe1c k\xeanh kh\xe1c c\u1ee7a FIS. Vi\u1ec7c Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 sau th\u1eddi h\u1ea1n th\xf4ng b\xe1o v\u1ec1 c\xe1c n\u1ed9i dung s\u1eeda \u0111\u1ed5i, b\u1ed5 sung trong t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3 \u0111\u1ed3ng ngh\u0129a v\u1edbi vi\u1ec7c Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\xe3 ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn c\xe1c n\u1ed9i dung s\u1eeda \u0111\u1ed5i, b\u1ed5 sung \u0111\xf3.\n13.2. Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng \u0111\xe3 bi\u1ebft r\xf5 v\xe0 \u0111\u1ed3ng \xfd b\u1ea3n Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y c\u0169ng l\xe0 Th\xf4ng b\xe1o x\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n quy \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ea1i \u0110i\u1ec1u 13 Ngh\u1ecb \u0111\u1ecbnh 13/N\u0110-CP/2023 v\xe0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eeda \u0111\u1ed5i, b\u1ed5 sung trong t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3 tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi FIS ti\u1ebfn h\xe0nh X\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n. Theo \u0111\xf3. FIS kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n th\xeam b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 bi\u1ec7n ph\xe1p n\xe0o kh\xe1c n\u1eb1m m\u1ee5c \u0111\xedch th\xf4ng b\xe1o vi\u1ec7c X\u1eed l\xfd D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n cho Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng.\n13.3. Khi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\xeau c\u1ea7u th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n quy\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng theo \u0110i\u1ec1u 9.1 t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\xeau c\u1ea7u, FIS s\u1ebd th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\xe1c b\u01b0\u1edbc c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 x\xe1c nh\u1eadn, nh\u1eadn d\u1ea1ng c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\xeau c\u1ea7u tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi tri\u1ec3n khai c\xe1c quy\u1ec1n m\xe0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\xeau c\u1ea7u mu\u1ed1n \xe1p d\u1ee5ng. Trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft, nh\u1eb1m x\xe1c minh danh t\xednh v\xe0 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o t\xednh b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt c\u1ee7a d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng, FIS c\xf3 th\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u1edbp d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n cung c\u1ea5p b\u1edfi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\xeau c\u1ea7u khi g\u1eedi y\xeau c\u1ea7u th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n quy\u1ec1n v\u1edbi d\u1eef li\u1ec7u m\xe0 FIS \u0111\xe3 v\xe0 \u0111ang l\u01b0u tr\u1eef.\nTr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p FIS th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n vi\u1ec7c x\xf3a, h\u1ee7y, hay h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1eef li\u1ec7u theo y\xeau c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng, c\xe1c quy\u1ec1n l\u1ee3i c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng theo h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng, th\u1ecfa thu\u1eadn d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 k\xfd v\u1edbi FIS m\xe0 \u0111\xf2i h\u1ecfi ph\u1ea3i s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n n\xf3i tr\xean, c\xf3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb gi\xe1n \u0111o\u1ea1n, thay \u0111\u1ed5i, ho\u1eb7c ch\u1ea5m d\u1ee9t.\n13.4. Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng cam k\u1ebft th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n nghi\xeam t\xfac c\xe1c quy \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ea1i Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y. C\xe1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c quy \u0111\u1ecbnh, c\xe1c B\xean th\u1ed1ng nh\u1ea5t th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt, h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u1ee7a c\u01a1 quan Nh\xe0 n\u01b0\u1edbc c\xf3 th\u1ea9m quy\u1ec1n v\xe0/ho\u1eb7c c\xe1c s\u1eeda \u0111\u1ed5i, b\u1ed5 sung Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c FIS th\xf4ng b\xe1o cho Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng trong t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3.\n13.5. Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng c\xf3 th\u1ec3 th\u1ea5y qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o ho\u1eb7c n\u1ed9i dung kh\xe1c tr\xean b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 trang tin \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ho\u1eb7c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb n\xe0o c\xf3 th\u1ec3 li\xean k\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn c\xe1c trang tin \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a c\xe1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\xe1c, nh\xe0 qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o, nh\xe0 t\xe0i tr\u1ee3 ho\u1eb7c c\xe1c b\xean th\u1ee9 ba kh\xe1c.\nFIS kh\xf4ng ki\u1ec3m so\xe1t n\u1ed9i dung ho\u1eb7c c\xe1c li\xean k\u1ebft xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n tr\xean c\xe1c trang tin \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a b\xean th\u1ee9 ba v\xe0 kh\xf4ng ch\u1ecbu tr\xe1ch nhi\u1ec7m ho\u1eb7c/v\xe0 tr\xe1ch nhi\u1ec7m ph\xe1p l\xfd \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\xe1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng b\u1edfi c\xe1c trang tin \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a b\xean th\u1ee9 ba \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c li\xean k\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn ho\u1eb7c t\u1eeb b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 trang tin \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ho\u1eb7c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb n\xe0o. C\xe1c trang tin \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed v\xe0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\xe0y c\xf3 th\u1ec3 tu\xe2n theo c\xe1c ch\xednh s\xe1ch b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt v\xe0 \u0111i\u1ec1u kho\u1ea3n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a ri\xeang c\u1ee7a b\xean th\u1ee9 ba.\n13.6. Ch\xednh s\xe1ch n\xe0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao k\u1ebft tr\xean c\u01a1 s\u1edf thi\u1ec7n ch\xed gi\u1eefa FIS v\xe0 Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng. Trong qu\xe1 tr\xecnh th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n n\u1ebfu ph\xe1t sinh tranh ch\u1ea5p, c\xe1c B\xean s\u1ebd ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft th\xf4ng qua th\u01b0\u01a1ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, h\xf2a gi\u1ea3i. Tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p h\xf2a gi\u1ea3i kh\xf4ng th\xe0nh, tranh ch\u1ea5p s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01b0a ra T\xf2a \xe1n nh\xe2n d\xe2n c\xf3 th\u1ea9m quy\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ph\xe1p lu\u1eadt.\n",e.termDefaultEn="\nThis Personal Data Privacy Policy (\u201cPolicy\u201d) is implemented by FPT Information System Corporation (\u201cFIS\u201d, \u201cCompany\u201d), describing the activities related to the processing of the Customer's Personal Data, in order that the Customer can have better understanding of the purposes, scopes of information processed by FIS, and measures applied by FIS to protect Customer\u2019s information and privacy rights.\nThis Policy is an integral part of the contracts, agreements, terms, and conditions binding the relationship between FIS and the Customer.\nArticle 1. Subjects and scope of application\nThis Policy governs the way in which FIS collects, processes, and stores the Personal Data of the Customer using or interacting with FIS\u2019s products, websites, or services and/or related persons of the Customer according to the relationships required by law to collect; and/or co-own and use FIS's products/services.\nFIS encourages the Customer to read this Policy carefully and regularly check the website for any changes that FIS may make to the terms of the Policy.\nArticle 2. Interpretation of terms\n2.1.\u201cCustomer\u201d means an individual who approaches, learns, registers, uses or is involved in the operation and provision of FIS\u2019s products and services.\n2.2.\u201cFIS\u201d includes FPT Information System Corporation and FPT Information System Corporation's Affiliates.\n\u201cFPT Corporation\u201d includes FPT Corporation and FPT Corporation\u2019s Affiliates in accordance with governance standards.\n2.3.\u201cPersonal Data\u201d means information in the form of symbols, letters, numbers, images, sounds or the like on an electronic medium that is associated with a particular person or helps identify a particular person.\n2.4.\u201cPersonal Data protection\u201d is the activity of preventing, detecting, stopping, and handling violations related to the Personal Data in accordance with the law.\n2.5.\u201cPersonal Data processing\u201d is one or more activities affecting the Personal Data, such as: collection, recording, analysis, confirmation, storage, correction, disclosure, association, access, tracking, recover, encrypt, decrypt, copy, share, transmit, provide, transfer, delete, destroy the Personal Data or other related actions.\n2.6.\u201cPersonal Data Controller\u201d refers to an organization or individual that decides purposes and means of processing the Personal Data.\n2.7.\u201cThird party\u201d is an organization or individual other than FIS, the Personal Data Controller and the Customer who has been explained in accordance with this Policy.\nFor further clarification, any terms not explained in this Article shall be construed and applied in accordance with the laws of Vietnam.\nArticle 3. Purposes of processing the Customer\u2019s Personal Data\n3.1. The Customer approves that FIS and/or other organizations of FIS (as provided in Article 8 of this Policy) may process the Customer\u2019s Personal Data and share processing result for one or more of the following purposes:\n(a) Sign contracts and documents related to the Services and the provision of Services between FIS and the Customer;\n(b) Respond to Customer\u2019s service requests and support needs\n(c) Verify the identity and ensure the confidentiality of Customer\u2019s personal information, support the Customer to update his/her information when purchasing, using the products, services provided by FIS;\n(d) Provide the Customer with requested Company\u2019s products or services; products and services of partners/suppliers that FIS acts as an agent/cooperator to provide;\n(e) Adjust, update, secure and improve products, services, applications and devices provided by FIS or FPT Corporation to the Customer;\n(f) Notify the Customer of changes to policies and promotions of products and services provided by FIS or FPT Corporation;\n(g) Measurement, analysis of internal data and other processing to develop, improve, improve the quality of services/products of FIS or FPT Corporation or perform other activities of marketing, communications;\n(h) Prevention of fraud, identity theft and other illegal activities;\n(i) To have a basis for establishing, exercising the legal rights or defending the legal claims of FIS, the Customer or any individual. These purposes may include exchanging data with other companies and organizations for fraud prevention and detection, credit risk reduction;\n(j) Comply with applicable laws, relevant industry standards and other applicable Company\u2019s policies;\n(k) Any other purpose exclusively for the operation of the Company; and\n3.2. FIS will, directly or through the Personal Data Controller, request Customer's permission before using the Customer's Personal Data for any purpose other than the purposes stated in Article 3.1 above, at the time of collecting the Customer's Personal Data or before commencing related processing or as otherwise required or permitted by applicable law.\nArticle 4. Confidentiality of the Customer\u2019s Personal Data\n4.1. Customer's Personal Data is committed to maximum confidentiality in accordance with FIS's regulations and the law. The processing of Personal Data of each Customer is carried out only with the consent of the Customer, unless otherwise provided for by law\n4.2. FIS shall not use, transfer, provide or share to any third-party Customer's Personal Data without the Customer's consent, unless otherwise provided by law.\n4.3. FIS shall comply with other Personal Data privacy principles in accordance with applicable laws.\nArticle 5. Types of Personal Data collected and processed by FIS\nIn order for FIS to be able to provide products and services to the Customer and/or process Customer's requests, FIS is entitled to collect and/or request to collect the following types of the Personal Data:\n5.1.Basic Personal Data of the Customer and his/her related individuals:\n(a) Full name, middle name and birth name, other name (if any);\n(b) Gender;\n(c) Contact address;\n(d) Nationality;\n(e) Image of the individual;\n(f) Phone number, identity card number, personal identification number\n(g) Other information that is tied to a particular person or helps to identify a specific person and is not part of Sensitive Personal Data;\n(h) Other data as required by applicable law.\n5.2. D\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n b\u1ed5 sung g\u1eafn li\u1ec1n v\u1edbi quy\u1ec1n ri\xeang t\u01b0 c\u1ee7a Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng g\u1ed3m:\n(a) Other Personal Data regulated by law as special and require necessary security measures.\nFIS absolutely does not collect the Personal Data related to Customer\u2019s religion or political opinions.\nArticle 6. Personal Data collection methods\nFIS collects the Personal Data from the Customer in the following ways:\n6.1. Directly from the Customer by various means:\n(a) When the Customer enters into contract, purchases or uses any third-party services through FIS or FIS's locations and business establishments.\n(b) When the Customer submits a registration request or any other form related to the products and services of FIS;\n(c) When the Customer interacts with the Company's customer service staff, for example through phone calls, letters, face-to-face meetings, emailing or social media interactions;\n(d) When the Customer uses certain services of FIS, such as websites and applications including setting up online accounts with FIS;\n(e) When the Customer is contacted and responded to by marketing representatives and customer service personnel of FIS;\n(f) When the Customer submits his/her personal information to the Company for any other reason, including when the Customer signs up for a free trial of any products and services or when the Customer is currently interested in any of the Company's products and services.\n6.2. From other third parties:\n(a) If the Customer interacts with third-party content or advertising on the website or in the application, the Company may receive the Customer\u2019s personal information from the relevant third party, according to that third party's legally applicable privacy policy;\n(b) If the Customer chooses to pay electronically directly to FIS or through a website or application, FIS may receive the Customer's Personal Data from third parties, such as suppliers of payment service, for that purpose;\n(c) In order to comply with its obligations under applicable law, FIS may receive the Personal Data about the Customer from legal authorities and public authorities in accordance with the law;\n(d) FIS may receive the Personal Data about the Customer from public sources (such as telephone directories, advertising information/brochures, information publicly available on websites, etc.);\n(e) Whenever such Personal Data is collected, FIS will ensure that it receives the data from relevant third parties in lawful ways and holds those third parties responsible for compliance with the law legislation on the protection of Personal Data.\nArticle 7. Personal Data Processing Methods\nFIS shall apply one or several actions affecting Personal Data such as: collect, record, analyze, confirm, store, edit, publish, combine, access, retrieve, retrieve, encode, decode, copy, share, transmit, make available, transfer, delete, destroy or other related actions.\nArticle 8. Organizations Processing the Personal Data\n8.1. FIS (FPT Information System Corporation).\n8.2. FIS will share or jointly process the Personal Data with the following organizations and individuals:\n(a) FPT Corporation and its affiliate companies that FPT Corporation directly or indirectly owns;\n(b) FPT Information System Corporation\u2019s affiliate companies that FIS directly or indirectly owns;\n(c) Contractors, agents, partners, and operating service providers of FIS;\n(d) Branches, business units and employees working at branches, business units, agents of FIS;\n(e) Telecom businesses in case the Customer violates the obligation to pay service charges;\n(f) Commercial stores and retailers related to the implementation of promotional programs of FIS;\n(g) Professional advisors of FIS such as auditors, lawyers, etc. in accordance with the law;\n(h) Courts, competent state agencies in accordance with the provisions of law and/or as required and permitted by law.\n8.3. FIS commits that the sharing or co-processing of the Personal Data is performed only in cases where it is necessary to fulfill the Processing Purposes stated in this Policy or as required by law. Organizations and individuals that receive the Customer's Personal Data will have to comply with the content specified in this Policy and relevant laws on Personal Data protection.\nAlthough FIS will make every effort to ensure that Customer\u2019s information is anonymized/encrypted, the risk that such data may be disclosed in the event of force majeure cannot be completely excluded.\n8.4. In the event of the participation of other Personal Data processing organizations mentioned in this Article, FIS will notify the Customer before implementation.\nArticle 9. Rights and obligations of the Customer related to Personal Data provided to FIS\n9.1. The Customer\u2019s rights\n(a) The Customer has the right to know about his/her Personal Data processing activities, unless otherwise provided by law.\n(b) The Customer may or may not consent to the processing of his/her Personal Data, unless otherwise provided by law.\n(c) The Customer is entitled to access to view, correct or request correction of his/her Personal Data in writing to FIS or the Personal Data Controller, unless otherwise provided for by law.\n(d) The Customer has the right to withdraw his/her consent in writing to FIS/the Personal Data Controller, unless otherwise provided for by law. Withdrawal of consent does not affect the legality of the data processing agreed by the Customer prior to the withdrawal of consent.\n(e) The Customer has the right to delete or request deletion of his/her Personal Data in writing to FIS, unless otherwise provided for by law.\n(f) The Customer is entitled to request restriction of processing of his/her Personal Data in writing to FIS, unless otherwise provided for by law.\n(g) The Customer is entitled to request FIS/the Personal Data Controller to provide himself/herself with his/her Personal Data in writing to FIS, unless otherwise provided for by law.\n(h) The Customer has the right to object to FIS, the Personal Data Controller specified in this Policy from processing his/her Personal Data in writing to FIS, the Personal Data Controller in order to prevent or limit the disclosure of the Personal Data or use the Personal Data for advertising and marketing purposes, unless otherwise provided for by law.\n(i) After receiving requests for Personal Data provision; request restriction of the Personal Data processing; request to object to the Personal Data processing; or request to delete the Personal Data, FIS/the Personal Data Controller will respond within 72 hours after receiving the data subject's requests depending on each case in accordance with the law.\n(j) For requests to edit the Personal Data, in case they cannot be done, FIS/the Personal Data Controller will notify the Customer after 72 hours of receiving the requests.\n(k) The Customer is entitled to complain, denounce or initiate lawsuits in accordance with the law.\n(l) The Customer is entitled to claim compensation for actual damage in accordance with the law if FIS commits a violation of the regulations on the protection of his/her Personal Data, unless otherwise agreed by the parties or otherwise provided by law.\n(m) The Customer is entitled to protect himself/herself according to the provisions of the Civil Code, other relevant laws, or request competent agencies or organizations to implement civil rights protection methods as prescribed in Article 11 of the Civil Code.\n(n) Other rights as prescribed by applicable laws.\n9.2. The Customer\u2019s obligations\n(a) Comply with laws, regulations and instructions of FIS regarding the processing of the Customer's Personal Data.\n(b) Provide fully, honestly and accurately the Personal Data and other information as required by FIS when registering and using FIS's services and in case there is a change in this information. FIS will proceed to secure the Customer's Personal Data based on registered Customer\u2019s information, so if there is any false information, FIS will not be responsible in case such information affects or restrict the rights of the Customer. In case of failure to notify, if there is a risk or loss, the Customer will be responsible for errors or acts of abuse or fraud when using the service due to his/her fault or failure to provide correct and complete, sufficient, accurate and timely information changes; including financial losses, costs incurred due to incorrect or inconsistent information.\n(c) Coordinate with FIS, competent state agencies or a third party in case of problems affecting the security of the Customer's Personal Data.\n(d) Protect the Customer\u2019s own Personal Data; proactively apply measures to protect his/her Personal Data in the process of using FIS's Services; promptly notify FIS when detecting errors, mistakes in his/her Personal Data or suspecting that his/her Personal Data is being infringed.\n(e) To be solely responsible for the information, data and consents that the Customer creates and provide in the network environment; self-responsible in case the Personal Data is leaked or infringed due to his/her fault.\n(f) Regularly update FIS's Regulations and Policies from time to time, which are notified to the Customer or posted on FIS's websites and or other transaction channels from time to time. Take actions according to FIS's instructions to clearly indicate approval or disapproval for the purposes of processing the Personal Data that FIS informs the Customer from time to time.\n(g) Respect and protect the Personal Data of the others.\n(h) Other responsibilities as prescribed by applicable laws.\nArticle 10. Storage of the Personal Data\nFIS commits to only storing the Customer\u2019s Personal Data in cases related to the purposes stated in this Policy. Data storage time will be 10 (ten) years from the receipt of the Personal Data and decided by FIS to ensure the implementation of the above purposes.\nArticle 11. Undesirable consequences and damages\nCurrently, FIS has not seen any undesirable consequences or damages that may occur, FIS will make notifications when specific cases occur. During the processing of Personal Data, the Personal Data may be exposed due to:\n8.5. From the Customer's side: The Customer reveals or leaks the Personal Data due to carelessness or fraud; the Customer visits websites/download applications containing malware, etc.\n8.6. From the Company\u2019s side: FIS commits to using information security technologies to protect the Customer\u2019s Personal Data. However, no data can be 100% secure. Hardware and software errors may occur during data processing, causing loss of the Customer\u2019s Personal Data; or there are security holes beyond the control of FIS, the relevant system is attacked by hackers, causing data leakage; etc.\nArticle 12. Personal Data processing contact information\nIn case the Customer has any questions regarding this Policy or issues related to the data subject's rights or the processing of the Customer's Personal Data, the Customer may use the contacts listed below:\nSend an email to the email box corresponding to each type of service or product listed below: [email of the Unit]\nEMAIL: customersupport@fpt.com HOTLINE 24/7: 1900.636.191 - ext 3\nADDRESS: 22nd FLOOR, KEANGNAM LANDMARK TOWER, E6, PHAM HUNG STREET, ME TRI, NAM TU LIEM DISTRICT, HANOI, VIETNAM.\nArticle 13. General Terms\n13.1. This Policy is effective from July 1st, 2023. The Customer understands and agrees that this Policy may be amended from time to time and notified to the Customer through FIS's Transactional Channels before application. Changes and effective time will be updated and announced at FIS's transaction channels and other channels. The Customer's continued use of the Service after the notice period on the revised and supplemented contents from time to time means that the Customer has accepted such modified and supplemented contents.\n13.2. The Customer has fully understood and agreed that this Policy is also the Notice of Personal Data Processing specified in Article 13 of the Decree No. 13/2023/ND-CP and is amended and supplemented from time to time before FIS conduct the Personal Data processing. Accordingly, FIS does not need to take any other measures for the purpose of notifying the Processing of Personal Data to the Customer.\n13.3. Upon receiving a request to exercise the Customer's rights under Article 9.1 from the requester, FIS will take the necessary steps to confirm and identify the requester before implementing the rights that the requester wants to apply. In case of necessity, to verify the identity and ensure the confidentiality of the Customer's Personal Data, FIS may match the Personal Data provided by the requester when submitting a request to exercise rights with data that FIS has been storing.\nIn case FIS deletes, destroys, or limits the use of data at the request of the Customer, the Customer's rights under the contract or service agreement signed with FIS requiring the use of the Personal Data may be interrupted, changed, or terminated.\n13.4. The Customer commits to strictly comply with the provisions of this Policy. The issues have not been regulated, the Parties agree to comply with the provisions of the laws, the guidance of the competent State agencies and/or the amendments and supplements to this Policy notified by FIS to the Customer from time to time.\n13.5. The Customer may see advertising or other content on any website, application or device that may link to the websites or services of partners, advertisers, sponsors or other third parties.\nFIS has no control over the content or links appearing on third-party websites or services and is not responsible and/or liable for the activities used by such third party\u2019s websites or service linked to or from any website, application, or device. These websites and services may be subject to the privacy policies and terms of use of third parties.\n13.6. This Policy is entered into based on goodwill between FIS and the Customer. During the implementation process, if any disputes arise, the Parties will actively resolve it through negotiation and conciliation. In case of unsuccessful conciliation, the disputes will be brought to the competent People's Court for settlement in accordance with law.\nFPT INFORMATION SYSTEM CORPORATION\n"}),2749,[1,1182,196,751,453]);
